{{Breaknotes
| name = Galvanized
| desc = Disables the buff stack gain.<br><br>However, permanent existing stacks are not removed.
}}

 * The ability has two main components:
** Grants {{M|mana regeneration}} bonus per [[charge]] and per buff stack.
*** Grants both a charge and a stack in the following conditions:
**** {{Symbol|Affect|Enemy}} {{to}} {{Symbol|Death}}
***** Upon enemy heroes' [[death]], in any way, within the radius.
***** Considers {{A|Meepo|Meepo Clones}} as heroes; other {{M|clones}}, {{M|illusions}}, and {{M|creep-heroes}} as creeps.
*** Does not grant bonuses in the following conditions:
**** Outside the enemy death radius.
**** Killing an {{M|allied hero|x}}.
** [[File:Dota2 Condition-1.png|1|21px]] {{Symbol|bonus charges}}
*** Grants permanent {{#var:Galvanized value1}} [[mana regeneration]] bonus per [[charge]] gained.
** [[File:Dota2 Condition-2.png|2|21px]] {{Symbol|Modifier|Stack}} {{to}} {{Symbol|Modifier|Buff}} {{Code|storm_spirit_galvanized}}
*** Additionally grants {{#var:Galvanized type1 value4}} mana regeneration bonus per charge gained per stack.
*** {{Symbol|Affect|Self}} {{to}} {{Symbol|Death}}
**** Does not lose stacks with {{M|reincarnation}} sources.

* {{cf|expr}}
** {{M|Charge}} increase per hero level: {{Code|[[wikipedia:Floor and ceiling functions|⌊]] SelfLvl / {{#var:Galvanized type3 value1}} [[wikipedia:Floor and ceiling functions⌋|⌋]]}}

